{"policyVersion":3,"items":[{"translations":{"en":["Gun God","With the arrival of mysterious super-era technology, Gene Lock promotes unprecedented strengthening of human body functions such as speed, power and senses. Those who successfully open the genetic lock are able to become \"agents\", with the best among the agents being the \"gun gods\". Around the new armament of gene lock, various forces fiercely struggled to establish academies to cultivate agents. With the breakthrough and application of experiments, and the coercion from the mysterious race, the world has gradually fallen into the quagmire of war. After the war, the mysterious race disappeared, and the agents and spears became unproven urban legends. The only remaining two special agent organizations, \"Deep Sea\" and \"Dead Snake\", moved their bases to the seabed and underground, respectively, without disturbing each other. However, under a peaceful scene, it is actually in crisis. The dark tide is still tumbling, and the great wheel of history has never stopped spinning. \n\n\n\nThe story begins when the master fair fan Lin Xiaoshuai accidentally enters the Deep Sea Special Academy. In this unusual and mysterious campus, Xiaoshuai and his companions will aim to inherit the genetic lock, become an agent and even a gun god, learning martial arts, combat, and firearms.\n\n\n\nThe animation is divided into four chapters: Secret Service Academy, Special Agent World, Secret History of Blood Race, and Deep Sea Falling, each with 12 episodes and 48 episodes in total.\n\n\n\n(Baidu, edited)"],"ja":["枪神记",""]},"airedAt":null,"relations":[{"id":42149,"relation":"sequel"}],"id":"mal-39231","ids":{"shikimori":39231,"mal":39231,"anilist":107906,"kodik":"serial-42890"},"kodikIds":["serial-35976","serial-42890"],"kodikRevisions":{"serial-35976":"2021-07-17T14:51:24Z","serial-42890":"2022-05-12T12:31:53Z"},"title":"Век стрелка","originalTitle":"Qiang Shen Ji","alt":"Век стрелка / Age of Gunslingers / Gun God Gun God 枪神记","description":"Генная блокировка - таинственная и революционная технология, которая повышает скорость, силу и чувствительность человека до беспрецедентного уровня. Те, кто успешно открывает свою генную блокировку, становятся \"агентами\" новой эры, а самые выдающиеся из них известны как \"Боги оружия\". За это новое оружие разгорается ожесточенная борьба, которая приводит к созданию академий для подготовки агентов. По мере того, как эксперименты прорываются наружу и применяются на практике, в сочетании с принуждением со стороны таинственной расы, мир постепенно погружается в трясину войны... После окончания войны таинственная раса исчезает, а агенты и Оружейные Боги становятся непроверяемыми городскими легендами. Две оставшиеся крупные агентурные организации, \"Глубоководье\" и \"Дикий змей\", переносят свои базы на морское дно и под землю соответственно, ведя уединенное существование. Однако под этим мирным фасадом повсюду таится опасность.","year":2017,"type":"ONA","genres":["Экшен","Фантастика"],"rating":6.35,"popularity":502,"ongoing":false,"relatedMalIds":[42149],"artwork":{"poster":{"url":"https://shikimori.io/uploads/poster/animes/39231/501e3f0d35b4c6697e938c6a7618a646.jpeg","width":710,"height":995},"backdrop":{"url":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/107906-XEbG8K2DJKSo.jpg","width":1680,"height":680}},"releasedEpisodes":[1,2,3,4,5,6,7,8],"episodes":[{"number":1,"ordinal":1,"season":1,"audio":[{"id":"kodik-609","dubId":"609","label":"AniDUB","language":"ru","original":false,"duration":null,"sources":[],"subtitles":[],"opening":null,"ending":null,"validation":"provider-link","providerRef":{"provider":"kodik","releaseId":"serial-35976","translationId":"609","url":"https://kodikplayer.com/seria/857027/e15919c85a51e5ec2907c67086c7e8e9/720p","season":1,"ordinal":1}},{"id":"kodik-1043","dubId":"1043","label":"Animy","language":"ru","original":false,"duration":null,"sources":[],"subtitles":[],"opening":null,"ending":null,"validation":